{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"个性化基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"personalization-taxonomy","title":"个性化分类体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/foundations/personalization-taxonomy","wordCount":2701,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-modeling","title":"用户建模技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/foundations/user-modeling","wordCount":2522,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"context-signals","title":"上下文信号处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/foundations/context-signals","wordCount":2644,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"个性化基础\">个性化基础</h1><h2 id=\"本章概览\">本章概览</h2><p>个性化技术的本质是在用户、商品、场景三者之间建立精准的匹配关系。本章从技术分类框架出发，建立个性化引擎的理论地基，厘清不同技术路线的边界与联系，为后续章节的算法学习和系统实现奠定概念基础。</p>\n<p>本章包含三篇文档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"personalization-taxonomy\">个性化分类体系</a>：协同过滤、内容过滤、混合系统、知识增强四大技术流派的定义与权衡</li>\n<li><a href=\"user-modeling\">用户建模技术</a>：用户画像构建、兴趣演化建模、行为序列表征的方法论</li>\n<li><a href=\"context-signals\">上下文信号处理</a>：时间、地点、设备、场景等上下文维度的融入方式</li>\n</ul>\n"}